      ],
      "Project Type": "Website Project",
      "Project Type Description": "A Website Project is a comprehensive initiative to design, develop, and optimize a digital platform that meets user needs and business goals. During this project, teams produce deliverables such as user personas, site maps, and accessibility analyses to inform design decisions, along with prototypes, content strategies, and analytics reports to ensure a user-centered and high-performing website.",
