      "Project Type Description": "A Web Application Project is a collaborative effort to design, develop, and optimize a user-centric web platform that meets business goals and user needs. During this project, teams produce detailed user experience strategies, wireframes, prototypes, and functional code, along with comprehensive research reports, branding assets, and accessibility guidelines to ensure a seamless and engaging user experience.",
