      ],
      "Project Type": "Discovery Project",
      "Project Type Description": "A Discovery Project is a collaborative effort to understand user needs, define problem spaces, and identify viable solutions to inform product development. During this project, teams produce insights through qualitative and quantitative UX research, user journey maps, and strategic documentation, culminating in a clear product vision and prioritized roadmap to guide subsequent design and development phases.",
